{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, then approach it. If at object, then pick up and deposit after processing properties. If not, search. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = DepositObject    /> <Action ID = IsAtObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = FindAndRetrieveObject    />\"",
